 Starting Point

The player begins in a fully vanilla survival environment.

 Available

 Vanilla world generation and survival mechanics
 Vanilla crafting
 Vanilla tools and equipment, including Netherite
 Vanilla furnaces and other vanilla utility blocks
 Vanilla resources
 GregTech and Modern Industrialization ores may generate in the world, but their materials are not immediately part of the starting progression
 Vanilla exploration and progression

 Restricted

All modded technology and progression systems are locked at the beginning.

This includes:

 Create machinery
 GregTech machinery
 Modern Industrialization machinery
 Mekanism machinery
 AE2 systems
 Higher-tier power systems
 Modded automation
 Other progression-gated machines and systems

Magic progression is also not immediately available.

Starting Objective

The player must first establish themselves through vanilla survival.

The initial goals are:

1. Survive
2. Obtain basic resources
3. Build a stable base
4. Establish reliable food and resource sources
5. Progress through vanilla survival
6. Prepare to begin technological or magical progression

The Starting Point is intentionally focused on vanilla stabilization before industrialization.

 Progression Exit

The Starting Point ends when the player has sufficiently progressed through vanilla survival and begins pursuing the first technological progression.

The Vanilla stage must provide the resources and infrastructure required to begin the Primitive/Steam progression.

 Design Principle

Vanilla survival is not skipped by the modpack.

The player must first establish a functional vanilla foundation before accessing the industrial progression.
